@startuml "Student Profile Contract Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam sequenceMessageSize 22
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "StudentController" as SC
database "CSDL" as DB

Student -> FE: Mở hồ sơ
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/profile
SC -> DB: SELECT profile
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK

Student -> FE: Xem hợp đồng
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/contracts
SC -> DB: SELECT contracts
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
